WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.021
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind build a spreadsheet.

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:10.389
Cell: is one box in a worksheet. Row: runs horizontally across a sheet.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.959
Column: runs vertically down a sheet. Formula: calculates a result using values.

00:00:15.959 --> 00:00:19.925
Workbook: is a saved file containing one or more worksheets.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:25.477
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:25.477 --> 00:00:30.170
paper chart with the terms Cell, Row and Column; explain what each means.
